==Strategy==
As with many [[Uncanny Legends]] stages, lack of money is the killer here. If the enemies succeed in vanquishing your attackers, don't be afraid to stop spawning a couple of your meatshields so you can build up money to replace them.

Unsurprisingly, [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] and [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] excel here at dealing with the Capies. Pair them with 4 or so meatshields and the Capies should go down without much trouble.

Once you can get the enemies stalled for good, just use [[:Category:Long Distance Cats|Long Distance Cats]] like [[Red Riding Mina (Special Cat)|Awakened Mina]] to snipe Othom.

Syncing the Capies is obviously invaluable (see [https://youtu.be/e8YVxHYGcO4 this video] for more information on how to go about doing it). It is recommended that you start getting ready to sync them when the third Capy arrives on the battlefield.

